\f2\fs64 \cf0 \cb2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 CHAUMET CHRISTMAS \cf4 \cb2 \strokec4 18 Nov\cf0 \cb2 \strokec3 \'a0\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf0 \cb2 \strokec3 JVV took part with Chaumet, the high-jewelry brand of the LVMH group, in the 2025 edition of the Solidarity Christmas Tree, a charitable event in which the world\'92s leading luxury brands create unique, exclusive Christmas trees that are later auctioned. Our work included selecting and coordinating the welcome staff, as well as managing and producing the event\'92s music and visual content through our JVV People member,\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://jvv.com.es/en/portfolio_page/ayub-el-kadmiri-2-2/"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \strokec5 Ayub.}}\'a0An evening where creativity, philanthropy, and luxury come together to generate real social impact during the holiday season.\
\
